#: ../../library/persistence.rst:5
msgid "Data Persistence"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/persistence.rst:7
msgid ""
"The modules described in this chapter support storing Python data in a "
"persistent form on disk.  The :mod:`pickle` and :mod:`marshal` modules "
"can turn many Python data types into a stream of bytes and then recreate "
"the objects from the bytes.  The various DBM-related modules support a "
"family of hash-based file formats that store a mapping of strings to "
"other strings."
msgstr ""

